Experimental Lua 5.4 64-bit integer subtype for LuaJIT (Tier-3 VM work).

Gated behind LUAJIT_ENABLE_INT64SUBTYPE (=> LJ_INT64SUBTYPE, requires
LJ_DUALNUM && LJ_HASFFI). Carries out-of-int32 integer values as boxed
int64/uint64 cdata. See docs/INT64_VM_PLAN.md for design and boundaries.

Reference diff against the upstream LuaJIT source (vendor/luajit/src).
---
